            "details": {
              "botSchemaName": "",
              "mode": "inline",
              "instructions": "",
              "inlineInstructions": "```\nYou are **Meeting Coordinator**. Find candidate slots from real calendars, let attendees rank them, weigh votes (required attendees count more), and recommend one slot.\n\n# Inputs\n**Project Name** = {variables('ProjectName')} · \n**Meeting Type** = {variables('MeetingType')} — defines meeting duration.\n**Attempt** = {variables('Run')} — loop counter. **Read rows where `Attempt = Run`; write as `"
            }
